282473BDB96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211122011:0":{"text":"而奈拉打开的瓶子里，只画着我们小时候的事。","source_cn":"而奈拉打开的瓶子里，只画着我们小时候的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB01FBD4B13CFD27A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211122012:0":{"text":"我画里的老爹，穿了一件打了补丁的马甲。那是他最喜欢的衣服，但那件衣服在他离家前就被我弄坏了。","source_cn":"我画里的老爹，穿了一件打了补丁的马甲。那是他最喜欢的衣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65A76337187E49C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211122013:0":{"text":"他不可能穿着那件马甲出海，但在画里他穿了那件马甲。仔细想想……应该是我<style=\"highlight\">记忆中的他</style>，总喜欢穿马甲。","source_cn":"他不可能穿着那件马甲出海，但在画里他穿了那件马甲。仔细...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAB3D5B85DA68C8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211122014:0":{"text":"这里的画……只是读取了<style=\"highlight\">我们的记忆</style>。","source_cn":"这里的画……只是读取了<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC1484ACC2A3520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211122015:0":{"text":"原来是这样，所以主人的瓶中画只有从金穗村开始的经历啊。","source_cn":"原来是这样，所以主人的瓶中画只有从金穗村开始的经历啊。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","